See README.md (section "Installation") for how to build angsd.

Short version:
  git clone https://github.com/angsd/angsd.git
  cd angsd
  make            # fetches and builds the newest htslib develop into ./htslib

To use an htslib you already have instead:
  make HTSSRC=/path/to/htslib
  make HTSSRC=systemwide
